        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entwined is a visual novel horror game set in a hospital.  A lockdown has occurred and no one can escape.  Team up with either a nurse or a patient in order to escape the hospital.  Not everything is as it seems and don’t trust anyone or even yourself. Decide your fate! Will you overcome the fear?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214110/extras/836eec72c8de31c83cfee76278faf3bb.avif?t=1766080229\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214110/extras_big/836eec72c8de31c83cfee76278faf3bb.webp?t=1766080229 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 hand drawn images, no A.I. was used for this game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voiced characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the sinister reason around the lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214110/extras/90875f5e2cc37ec4a6a705a18e85389f.avif?t=1766080229\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4214110/extras_big/90875f5e2cc37ec4a6a705a18e85389f.webp?t=1766080229 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul>",
